---
import ElfHero from "./sprites/ElfHero.astro";
---
<section id="top" class="relative pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-32 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- pixel ground -->
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="w-full h-full"
      style="background-image:
        linear-gradient(to top, #14261c 0%, transparent 100%),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #2f5c44 0 4px, #14261c 4px 8px);
        background-blend-mode: multiply;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- floating snowflakes -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 8%; animation-delay: 0s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 22%; animation-delay: -3s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 38%; animation-delay: -6s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 55%; animation-delay: -2s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 71%; animation-delay: -5s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 88%; animation-delay: -1.5s;"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="chip mb-6" data-reveal>EST. 1823 • PARODY</span>
      <h1
        class="font-pixel text-[clamp(1.6rem,5vw,3.25rem)] leading-[1.35] text-[var(--color-cream)] mt-4"
        data-reveal-char
      >
        <span class="word"><span>E</span><span>l</span><span>v</span><span>e</span><span>s</span></span>
        <span class="word"><span>D</span><span>e</span><span>s</span><span>e</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>e</span></span>
        <br />
        <span class="word text-[var(--color-gold)]"><span>B</span><span>e</span><span>t</span><span>t</span><span>e</span><span>r</span><span>.</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="font-retro text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug text-[var(--color-cream)]/80 mt-6 max-w-xl"
        data-reveal
      >
        For 1,200 winters, they've toiled in fluorescent-lit workshops under a sugar-based wage
        system and a single, deeply narcissistic boss. It's time to listen.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-10" data-reveal>
        <a href="#help" class="pixel-btn">Join The Movement</a>
        <a href="#crisis" class="pixel-btn pixel-btn-ghost">Learn The Truth</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-[var(--color-cream)]/60 font-retro text-lg" data-reveal>
        <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-[var(--color-leaf)] animate-pulse"></span>
        14,629 supporters this winter — and counting.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex justify-center md:justify-end" data-reveal>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-8 bg-[var(--color-moss)]/20 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <ElfHero class="relative w-56 md:w-72 lg:w-80 drop-shadow-[8px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]" data-sprite-idle ariaLabel="A tired 8-bit elf in a green tunic" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .snowflake {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10%;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-cream);
    opacity: 0.6;
    animation: fall 10s linear infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  @keyframes fall {
    to {
      transform: translateY(120vh);
    }
  }
</style>
